1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,500
Welcome to the Agentic Marketing Suite, an institutional fleet of 19 autonomous AI agents built on Google Cloud for the All Things Agentic Hackathon.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:13,500
Digital marketing today is fragmented across isolated silos: market research, 90-day strategy, content calendars, and multimodal creative production.

3
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:20,500
Rather than a simple chatbot, we built an asynchronous enterprise fleet orchestrated via Google ADK 2.x Graph Workflows,

4
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:31,600
powered by Gemini 3.7 Flash and Vertex AI, and strictly governed by sacred #1ebe82 Human Financial Gates.

5
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:38,500
Here is our review console running live on Google Cloud Run behind Direct Identity-Aware Proxy.

6
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:43,000
An enterprise operator onboards a client through our structured wizard.

7
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,500
Behind the scenes, a Cloud Run Job triggers our ADK 2.x graph workflow.

8
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:54,500
Layer 1 executes Business Diagnostics, Audience Intelligence, and Competitive Radar, extracting brand USPs and Ideal Customer Profiles.

9
00:00:54,500 --> 00:01:04,200
Each agent output is a strictly typed memory block, streamed directly to Firestore Native without blocking active user sessions.

10
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:10,500
Now, witness our sacred #1ebe82 Human Gate in action. True enterprise automation requires zero blind spend.

11
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:17,500
When the Strategy Orchestrator finishes, the ADK 2.x workflow raises a native interrupt, cleanly suspending execution without burning idle compute.

12
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:23,000
In the review console, operators review visual deliverable cards rather than raw JSON.

13
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:28,500
I can inspect audience segments, edit strategic copy in-place, and click the emerald #1ebe82 approval button.

14
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:34,200
Instantly, Firestore updates and downstream execution automatically resumes.

15
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:42,500
Downstream, Layer 4 Production generates copy assets, visual creative specs via Gemini Flash Image, landing pages, and email nurture flows.

16
00:01:42,500 --> 00:01:49,000
With one click, the suite compiles this interactive 9-act presentation deck and executive report directly from Firestore memory.

17
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:54,500
For external distribution, our FastMCP gateway connects to Meta Ads and Resend,

18
00:01:54,500 --> 00:02:07,300
guarded by our Human Financial Authorization Gate and Model Armor powered by Google Gemma, which intercepts prompt injections and redacts sensitive PII.

19
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:14,000
Everything you see is deployed on Google Cloud via Pulumi IaC.

20
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:20,500
Here is our Cloud Run service with request-based billing: when idle, it scales to zero for zero dollar compute spend.

21
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:27,500
Here is our Firestore Native Memory Bank maintaining multi-week state across sessions, and Vertex AI logs running Gemini 3.7 Flash.

22
00:02:27,500 --> 00:02:35,000
Finally, our offline hermetic test suite runs 335 unit tests in under five seconds, guaranteeing 100% reliability.

23
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:44,500
Agentic Marketing Suite proves that autonomous multi-agent enterprise fleets are here today on Google Cloud. Thank you!
